   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": "Carolai Anise",
   "npc": "2132",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Nice to see a friendly face. I don't get much chitchat from Apothecary Johaan unless he wants something. He's been out of the grave too long. Someday I'll be like that, I hear. Creepy. Maybe by then I won't care.",
   "time": 1793841139,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "2425|7dca81fc": {
   "build": "70790",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1458,
   "name": "Varimathras",
   "npc": "2425",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Do not presume to speak to me as though you are my equal, $c. Sylvanas is my queen, and I will do as she bids.\n\nIf you do not show the proper respect, I assure you, we can find a more than suitable place for you in the Nether.\n\nBut there is no reason we cannot have words if you wish to aid the Dark Lady...",
   "time": 1793851849,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Undercity"
  },
  "251001|aab0700b": {
   "build": "70790",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": "Deathguard Kristof",
   "npc": "251001",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Actually I prefer traditional medicines... leeches, maggots, bonesaws... that sort of thing.  Well to each their own.  You can find the our local Herbalism Trainer, Faruza, standing out front near the stables in Brill.",
   "time": 1793839441,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "3549|2cec462d": {
